# Generated implementation report retained outside Git for local reference.
task-8-report.md

# Local experiment evidence (Phase 0/1 exploration output). Contains captured agent sessions,
# absolute machine paths in recorded git state, and measured outputs whose values are the point.
# Redacting them would rewrite measurements, so the tree stays local; the conclusions live in
# docs/architecture/ and experiments/*/README.md.
experiments/

# Raw agent session transcripts used as validation input: large, duplicated across experiment
# rounds, and containing real prompts. The reports, capture manifests and freeze manifests that
# constitute the evidence remain tracked.
docs/validation/**/*.jsonl

# Validation evidence tree. 67 of its files carry a real home path (only visible once the guard
# learned to decode JSON string escapes), 55 handoff outputs are SHA-256 bound in the freeze
# manifests, and 29 are raw session transcripts. Committing it as-is would publish a real username;
# redacting it would invalidate the manifests that attest those files. It therefore stays local
# until a redaction pass can regenerate those manifests. The accepted baseline reports under
# docs/validation/*.md remain tracked.
docs/validation/
